-$$ \mathcal{L} = w_p \mathcal{L}_{ph} + w_{pp} \mathcal{L}_{pp} + w_b \mathcal{L}_{bg} + w_p \mathcal{R}_p + w_o \mathcal{R}_o + \mathcal{R}_{TV} $$
